   "body": "Coordinator, from #165's recommendation 4. When the tuned harmonics are resolved to \u03bd = 25 or beyond, export them at 12 or more digits in modulus and phase, and redo the singularity analysis on them. Acceptance: the drift of the ratios is classed as a power law, with slope within 0.3 of 4 on \u03bd 5\u201321, while a planted two-pole control stays exponential. #165 found the data file's 7 digits set a floor near 1e-5 for its fits (solver/independent_eeg_eq16/REPORT.md).",
